stateDiagram-v2
	[*] --> ImageA: CDLL load (startup, gen 0)
	ImageA --> ImageA: calls mutate AphroditeState<br/>(bridge OnceLock / core HANDLES)
	ImageA --> [*]: process exits
	[*] --> ImageB: next Hermes session loads the new dylib
	note right of ImageB
